msgid "{name}, {address}, {port}, {user}, {group}, {folder} and {type} are the host's, each quoted for the shell. {password} is its password, given to the command as GCM_PASSWORD in its environment, never on a command line. It runs through sh, from your home folder."
msgstr "{name}, {address}, {port}, {user}, {group}, {folder} y {type} son los valores del host, cada uno entrecomillado para el shell. {password} es su contraseña, que se entrega al comando como GCM_PASSWORD en su entorno, nunca en una línea de comandos. Se ejecuta mediante sh, desde su carpeta personal."

